**What changed**

- **`src/tokenize.ts`** (new): `tokenize(text)` — lower-cased runs of letters, digits and apostrophes via `split(/[^a-z0-9']+/)` + non-empty filter. Verbatim body of the old `wordCount` minus `.length`, as spec'd. `'tis` stays `'tis`, `a-b 123` yields 3 tokens, no trimming of apostrophes.
