- **`src/stats.test.ts`**: kept the existing wordCount test, added the six spec'd tests (wordCount miscounts → 4 and `'... !!!'` → 0, topWords drift fix, alphabetical ties, n-slicing, tokenize case handling). Imports `tokenize` from `./tokenize.ts`.

